---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftScopeCoverage
---
Construct a ScopeCoverage draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Compare required functions with bid inclusions and exclusions, recognizing different descriptions of the same work. Separate supply, installation, commissioning, and certification responsibilities instead of assuming one broad line covers all phases.
